# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.lock
# ...except the Rust lockfile, which pins a native library that ships. The
# blanket *.lock above is aimed at pubspec.lock, and it caught this one by
# accident: h3-quinn 0.0.7 does not compile against current quinn, so the
# working versions are a fact about this crate rather than a preference, and
# an unpinned resolution can pick a broken pairing on a machine that has not
# built before.
#
# It also un-breaks the Rust cache key in .github/workflows/tests.yml, which
# hashes this file and was hashing something not in the repository.
!packages/dartvel_shelf/rust/Cargo.lock
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.buildlog/
.history



