# Local-only working directory for unrelated projects that share this
# workspace. Everything inside is excluded, so nothing beyond Dartvel can be
# published by a stray `git add -A`, a fresh clone, or a different machine —
# and the ignore rule itself does not disclose what is in there.
/.private/

